{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"screen\": \"光这么一点亲近就很甜，他还拿不准下次能不能更坦白些\",\n      \"source\": \"他心里其实已经很确定这份亲近对自己有多重要，只是还不敢把这份在意完全表现出来，怕表达得太明白会带来很大的变化。\",\n      \"type\": \"5\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"新增了觉得眼前亲近很甜以及对下次能否坦白的疑问，定稿只说他清楚这份亲近的重要性并害怕表达后的变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"screen\": \"如今连怎么待着都拿不准\",\n      \"source\": \"连接下来该把心思放在哪里都不太清楚。\",\n      \"type\": \"8\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"原意是失去支撑后不知道该把注意力放在哪里，屏幕稿泛化成不知道该如何待着，丢失了注意力转移这一具体意思。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"screen\": \"也许对方也喜欢他在身边，想到这儿他有点高兴\",\n      \"source\": \"心里还在反复问：“刚才那是真的吗？接下来怎么办？”\",\n      \"type\": \"5\",\n      \"severity\": \"严重\",\n      \"why\": \"新增了对方可能也喜欢与他相处的猜测，以及由此产生的高兴，定稿没有这层关于对方心意的判断。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"screen\": \"即使听到对方保证，心里还是会问，真能一直这样吗？\",\n      \"source\": \"仿佛怕一停下，刚刚得到的东西就会消失。\",\n      \"type\": \"5\",\n      \"severity\": \"严重\",\n      \"why\": \"新增了对方曾经作出保证这一情节，定稿只有害怕失去已经得到的东西，没有对方保证的内容。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"screen\": \"他想过少露些心意会不会少疼些，可刚才想对对方好也是真心的\",\n      \"source\": \"幸福没有消失，悲伤却进入了幸福内部。有时真正「得到」也会疼。\",\n      \"type\": \"5\",\n      \"severity\": \"严重\",\n      \"why\": \"新增了减少表达心意以避免受伤的自我保护念头，以及想对对方好的动机和真诚判断，定稿没有这些心理活动。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2ad9151c-be4f-4faf-b824-c2c00b95da44", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T103657226453Z", "elapsed_seconds": 301.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T10:41:58.439147+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "23d615fbd6aaa612c46d4a43e73d11d3a3a2d74da03cc94e812c067ddc92ab8b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T103657226453Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "be11bcf730489dcc865fcb1b17c6d3e0a8d0a5bf6e441448b8becf2cae21d8f5"}}}
